OL,3,AThe firms turning recruitment into X
OL,4,AFactor-style competitions
OL,5,
OL,6,FYumi Liberman was up on stage in front
OL,7,Fof a panel of judges and an audience of
OL,8,F300 people, and she had to perform.
OL,10,FBut rather than singing, dancing or
OL,11,Fplaying a musical instrument, she and
OL,12,Ftwo friends were in an auditorium in
OL,13,FLondon in 2024 to pitch their business
OL,14,Fidea, hoping to secure a full-time job
OL,15,Fwith cosmetics giant L'Oreal.
OL,17,F"It reminded me of when I used to do
OL,18,Fcompetitive sports growing up and the
OL,19,Fpressure would get heavy," says
OL,20,FLiberman, now 24. "But somehow you just
OL,21,Fget into flow mode."
