OL,5,
OL,6,FShe and her friends had got through to
OL,7,Fthe UK final of Brandstorm, an
OL,8,Finternational competition run by the
OL,9,FFrench company, where young adults
OL,10,Foutline their product and business
OL,11,Fideas.
